| name = Bash of the Deep
| desc = Disables the {{Symbol|Tally}} tally gain.<br><br>However, existing stacks are not removed.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Bash of the Deep icon0}}
| desc = After 3 attacks, your next attack will bash the target.
}}
* {{Symbol|Attack Speed}}
** For Slardar to continuously {{M|bash}} his attack target, he must have ≥ {{#expr:floor({{Show|H|Slardar|base attack time}}/({{#var:Bash of the Deep value3}}/{{#var:Bash of the Deep value1}})*100+1)}} [[attack speed]] or have an attack time of ≤ {{#expr:{{#var:Bash of the Deep value3}}/{{#var:Bash of the Deep value1}}}}s (before {{M|status resistance}} reductions).

* {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** The ability effects are applied as follows:
**# The {{M|bash}} {{M|debuff}}.
**# Slardar's attack damage instance with the {{M|physical}} {{M|conditional attack damage}} bonus.
**# The {{M|required attacks}} {{M|buff}} resets to 0.

* Considers {{M|illusions}} and {{M|creep-heroes}} as creeps.

fields.value:
 {{Puddlecraft}}

* Except the river water and {{M|neutral creep}} camps in water terrain, other water-based terrains must be created by Slardar for Seaborn Sentinel to be applied.
** The bonuses are no longer granted when Slardar is being moved by {{M|upward movement}} sources.

* Grants the following bonuses in water-based terrains:
** Flat {{M|bonus armor}}.
** Flat {{M|bonus attack damage}}.
** {{Symbol|bonus agh}} Stacks multiplicatively with other {{M|status resistance}} sources.

* Multiple instances of the river bonus do not stack.

* {{cf|expr}}
** {{M|Health regeneration}} bonus: {{Code|{{#var:Seaborn Sentinel value1}} + {{ValueColor||20|agh|x}} + ({{#var:Seaborn Sentinel basic1}} × SelfLvl)}}
** {{M|Bonus armor}}: {{Code|{{#var:Seaborn Sentinel value2}} + {{ValueColor||8|agh|x}} + ({{#var:Seaborn Sentinel basic2}} × SelfLvl)}}
** {{M|Bonus attack damage}}: {{Code|{{#var:Seaborn Sentinel value3}} + {{ValueColor||{{Show|T|Slardar|v3l}}%|tal|x}} + ({{#var:Seaborn Sentinel basic3}} × SelfLvl)}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Seaborn Sentinel icon0}}
| desc = Slardar gains bonus movement speed, health regeneration, attack damage, and armor while in a puddle, trail, or river.
}}
* {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
** All ability bonuses are still granted when Slardar becomes {{M|invulnerable}}.

