fields.value:
{{Stealnotes
| name = Corrosive Haze
| desc = The created puddles do not grant any water-based bonuses for {{H|Rubick}}.
}}

 * {{Symbol|Modifier|Debuff}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Reapplying the debuff refreshes the duration and updates the ability values immediately.
** {{cf|talnotes}} Both the {{ValueColor||armor reduction increasing|20tal}} and the {{ValueColor||debuff death dispel|25tal}} {{M|talent|t=t4l3r|text=talents}} do not update the current instance.
** {{Symbol|Vision|Base}}
*** {{M|Exposes}} with {{M|True Sight}}.
** [[File:Dota2 Slardar Puddle icon.png|21px|Puddle]]
*** Creates a puddle immediately upon applying the {{Code|amplify_damage}} debuff, subsequent puddles are created in {{#var:Corrosive Haze basic1}}-second intervals, in the following conditions:
**** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|CurrentUnitDistance ≥ {{#expr:{{#var:Corrosive Haze type1 value1}}/2}} of CurrentPuddle}}
*** Each puddle has its own independent duration.
*** Refreshes the duration the current puddle if there is a puddle within {{#var:Corrosive Haze type1 value1}} radius, centered around the affected enemy.
*** [[File:Dota2 Slardar Puddle icon.png|21px|Puddle]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Aura}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} 
**** Creates an [[aura]] that grants Slardar the {{A|Slardar|Seaborn Sentinel}} water-based terrain bonuses.
**** Unlike the river, the puddle created has a linger duration, and only grants the bonuses to Slardar.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Corrosive Haze icon0}}
| desc = Reduces enemy armor to amplify physical damage and provides True Sight and vision of the targeted unit, revealing invisibility. The enemy unit leaves a trail of water behind it.
}}
* [[File:Dota2 Slardar Puddle icon.png|21px|Puddle]] {{to}} {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
** Does not create a continuous trail of puddles.
** If the affected enemy unit has more than {{#expr:{{#var:Corrosive Haze type1 value1}}/2/{{#var:Corrosive Haze basic1}}}} {{M|movement speed}}, there will be gaps between the puddles.

